
================================================================
 CORTEX-M SECURITY POSTURE  (family: stm32-rdp)
================================================================
 (1) IDENTITY
   DBGMCU_IDCODE          DEV_ID=0x413 (STM32F405/407/415/417)  REV_ID=0x1000
   Unique device ID       deadbeef-12345678-cafebabe
   Flash size             1024 KB
 (2) READOUT PROTECTION
   RDP                    0xaa -> LEVEL 0 — no protection, flash fully readable (dev)
   Write-protect (nWRP)   0xfff  (bit=0 -> that sector write-protected)
   BOR level (BOR_LEV)    0x3
================================================================
 NOTE: reading any of the above proves the AHB-AP is OPEN -> internal flash is dumpable now.
================================================================
